# Host at https://<your-site>/ads.txt  (root of the domain). Needed for AdSense / Ad Manager so advertisers can verify you.
# Replace pub-0000000000000000 with YOUR publisher id (shown in AdSense). The last field is Google's certification id and is always f08c47fec0942fa0.
google.com, pub-0000000000000000, DIRECT, f08c47fec0942fa0

# For the Android app (AdMob): host app-ads.txt at the root of the DEVELOPER WEBSITE listed on your Google Play store listing, same line format.
